      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "Source fact recoverable at coarse level: the passage defines an empirical distribution for a normalized displacement A_m, displays even/odd moment limits, and names a Gaussian distribution function. Interpretation provisionally suggested by the source: the normalization is intended to expose a Gaussian fluctuation scale. Unresolved uncertainty: the normalization constants and final almost-all inequality are OCR-damaged, and the extracted final relation appears to have the opposite direction from the expected exceptional-tail statement. The claimed envelope therefore cannot be certified from this artifact.",
